{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "135933a9efa539ccd7ddc62c7bea0633a050589856a4fc6c1d7f43ea0fba5f40", "ja": "（バラエティ番組の企画で、\nロコは巨大なチョコタワーを制作したが……）", "zh": "（在综艺节目的企划中，ROCO制作了一座巨大的巧克力塔，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "6ac4ee7fb72ca8cbdb8d721a936e9700a0d57150e7c2df1338a5d6c11e8b789c", "ja": "うう、もう少しでサクセスできそうだったのに……\n最後の最後で……。ロコのミステイクです。", "zh": "呜呜，明明差一点就能成功了……\n却在最后的最后……这是ROCO的失误。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4b21de457a389e3b30c30d405c15fc881dfb91f0f1b41216d0c6c46b24530f2a", "ja": "最後は、惜しかったな。でも、\nあの大きさを時間内に作り上げただけでも立派だよ。", "zh": "最后关头，真的很可惜。不过，\n能在规定时间内做出那么大的作品，已经很了不起了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "d85b9b083d30428588ce442521db1b95174866041f48f4abd79f28525338afa2", "ja": "それは、プロフェッショナルとして当然です。でも、\nタワーがビッグになったのは、ロコのせいなんです。", "zh": "那是专业人士理所当然该做的。不过，塔之所以这么大，都是因为ROCO。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "6cfc44bd907579f49073b761b292c4e1048028b5e8bf2d6282797c790fdd099c", "ja": "モチベーションがバーニングしてしまって。もうひとつ\nシークレットなプランがあったんですけど……。", "zh": "因为干劲燃起来了。另外其实还有一个秘密计划……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1005_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "2ff0045bb453b7949feccc218b34ccb89711b30d8e28c2be514b013d043a0ccf", "ja": "あのタワーは……実は、{$P$}への\nプレゼントだったんです。", "zh": "那座塔其实是送给{$P$}的礼物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "49f61321c62d9b2fe44535575826047df17898b60ebd2f6cb11e2e44111cc80d", "ja": "感謝を伝えるベストなタイミングだと思ったのに、\n結局ダメになっちゃいました……ハア～。", "zh": "我本以为那是表达感谢的最佳时机，\n结果还是泡汤了……唉～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1008_p", "source_sha256": "17aa88b1d5b05553947480369ee0cafad05d3a5fb566d84968d2791d98591869", "ja": "そうだったのか……。\nありがとう、ロコ。その気持ちだけでも嬉しいよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……\n谢谢你，ROCO。光是这份心意就让我很开心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1010_p", "source_sha256": "686dada137bbb6a7033fde0a7c3376efa2781859388d28b00099d14a0f7380ff", "ja": "なあ、ロコ。さっきスタッフさんが\nタワーの残った部分を持ってきてくれたんだ。", "zh": "对了，ROCO。刚才工作人员把塔剩下的部分拿过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1013_p", "source_sha256": "897535cfcbf082d682c942923e560298216fea0a1aec8e92c948cbb86267d0c2", "ja": "うん、美味しい。すごい美味しい！\nそれに色んな味のチョコがあって面白いな。", "zh": "嗯，很好吃。特别好吃！\n而且里面有各种口味的巧克力，真有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "e07b8424a59dcb11ba076a65df061301da75c04613faf127b09847e8cedcfeec", "ja": "本当ですか！　えへへっ。テイストは、\nカオリとエミリーがアシストしてくれたんですよ。", "zh": "真的吗！嘿嘿。口味可是歌织和艾米莉帮忙调配的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "735f4f0fb05ccfd86f61b4a028437eb41e846618f9e68c1802ae968779e64a5c", "ja": "みんなでクリエイトするのは楽しかったです！　あとは\nパーフェクトな状態だったらよかったんですけど……。", "zh": "大家一起搞创作很开心！要是之后\n状态能达到完美就好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fd2f8f7e38e23340919ba1cd938ad1da93e08339cc10952838640e8b29035bc9", "ja": "ロコ……。", "zh": "ROCO……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d9159cbe5c644e01d157ab839c04382f4ff776e185000c501d97821f4daf0493", "ja": "そうだ、ロコも一緒に食べないか？\nちょっと量が多くて……手伝ってくれると助かる。", "zh": "对了，ROCO也要一起吃吗？  \n量有点多……你愿意帮忙的话就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "daf45c7cd08c75061a52aa222aa5e6c6d8c47fe49e03425298285443c67ce9a2", "ja": "あっ。チョコをヘビーにしたのはロコでしたね……。\nわかりました、ロコもアシストします！", "zh": "啊。把巧克力做得很有分量的是ROCO来着……  \n明白了，ROCO也会来帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "3210f62af23d3ad784f3da4c7ce31598cb60aeda4a5dc3942ea73c1a5acd25c4", "ja": "おおー。とってもデリシャスです！\nクリエイトの後は、やっぱりスイーツが一番ですね♪", "zh": "哦哦——非常美味呢！\n创作之后，果然还是甜点最棒了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0294_1020_p", "source_sha256": "285efc821fa7fcd4d6c0ace86ff8315f8fc98d12fc46e6f928111b3b2d07c615", "ja": "（その後、スタッフさん達にも手伝ってもらって\n完食した。美味しいロコアートは大好評だった！）", "zh": "（之后，在工作人员的帮助下也全部吃完了。美味的ROCO艺术大受好评！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
